{
  "_comment": [
    "Where the D'ni wrote. Two things no other room gives: pages drawn from the expert and master stocks",
    "rather than the whole corpus by rarity, and the desk implements themselves -- which design 7.6 wants",
    "to become salvage rather than furniture. Every implement can turn up, all of them rarely: a player who",
    "has reached a city has most of them already, so this is a second route rather than a shortcut past a",
    "material (Jonah, 2026-09-19).",
    "**The analysis machine is here, and for it this is the only route that exists** (Jonah, 2026-09-20).",
    "Its recipe takes masterwork paper, which comes from the tree, which is the endgame -- so a device whose",
    "whole job is teaching a midgame writer the words for blocks could not be built until long after it was",
    "wanted. A city is where the D'ni kept their apparatus, so a city is where it is found.",
    "The pair is split by what each one is: this is bench apparatus and belongs beside the desk, where the",
    "surveying device is something you carry to a place and stand up, and is the maintenance hall's."
  ],
